<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (The project assumes that users submit genuine waste reports and that moderators can correctly verify before-and-after cleanup photos. It also assumes that workers complete assigned tasks honestly. Since this is a prototype, payments are simulated instead of using a real payment gateway, and data is stored locally using files rather than a cloud database. These assumptions allow the project to focus on demonstrating the core workflow, data structures, and object-oriented design instead of real-world deployment challenges.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
